== About me
I am currently a fourth-year PhD candidate supervised by Prof. [https://ece.hkust.edu.hk/eeweiz Wei ZHANG] in [https://eeweiz.home.ece.ust.hk/ Reconfigurable computing system laboratory (RCSL)] at the Department of Electronic & Computer Engineering in HKUST.
Previously, I obtained my Bachelor’s Degree at the [https://icse.uestc.edu.cn/ School of Integrated Circuit Science and Engineering], University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC) in 2023.

== Research Interests 
Efficient AI \n
Hardware-Software Co-Design for AI Accelerator \n
3D Vision \n
Embodied AI \n

